<%# The diamond "spark" glyph for étincelles — points pill, splash screen.
    The app icon SVGs use the same polygon literally (rasterized outside the
    asset pipeline, can't render a partial), kept in sync by eye. %>
<span class="inline-block shrink-0 <%= size %> <%= color %>"
      style="clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 61% 39%, 100% 50%, 61% 61%, 50% 100%, 39% 61%, 0% 50%, 39% 39%)"
      aria-hidden="true"></span>
